+        "generated reduction image is solved by dense GF(2) Gaussian "
+        "elimination in O(n^3); at the shipping n=70 preset the reference "
+        "implementation's measured scalar operation count and wall time are "
+        "reported by G5/G6, whereas the cyclic recurrence uses at most "
+        "3n+12=222 exact bit operations after the structural change of variables."
+    ),
+    "max_answer_tokens": 70,
+}
