+The paper proves Directed Metric Dimension NP-complete on DAGs by a direct
+reduction from Hitting Set (Theorem 2).  This module uses that exact reduction.
+It inverse-generates a Hitting Set instance from a planted cyclic 3-XOR
+solution, exposes the resulting DAG by its compact defining data, and asks for
+the paper's normalized minimum resolving set.
