codex
I’m implementing the DAG family through the paper’s own Hitting Set reduction, not the linear-time co-graph algorithm. The source instance is a balanced planted NAE-style hitting system: every public ground element has exactly the same incidence frequency, so the planted witness has no degree/frequency tell, and the answer is carried into a directed resolving set exactly as the theorem’s proof specifies.
