+        "generated reduction image is solved by dense GF(2) Gaussian "
+        "elimination in O(q*n^2); at shipping n=70,q=120 the reference "
+        "implementation used 40,733 scalar operations in about 0.06 seconds "
+        "on the audit seed, whereas the cyclic recurrence uses at most "
+        "3n+12=222 exact bit operations after the structural change of variables."
