Then the green edges must be edges of $E(G)$ and the red edges must not be edges of $E(G)$.
There is no directed co-graph that has an induced subgraph with vertex set $\{u_1,v,u_2,w_1,w_2\}$ and all the necessary green edges but none of the forbidden red edges.}
