The corrected family now passes an independent check on the actual graph: for 96 exhaustive demo candidates across 12 seeds, a literal arc materialization plus BFS agrees with the symbolic checker on every candidate. I’ve also optimized the adversary implementation so the required 200k-guess and eight-seed panel can be rerun without changing the attacks themselves. The full measured self-test is running now; the shared runner is heavily loaded, so its wall time is longer than the prior report.
