The shipping preset has 36 growing choice groups, eight values per group, 252 balanced NAE rows, 540 Hitting Set members, and a normal-form space of `8^36`. Plants and decoys have exactly equal incidence frequency because every row is paired with its complement and every group appears once per regular round.
